[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0979","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0979.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0861","title":"GNU Mailman Mailman 1.1 代码执行漏洞","description":"Mailman 1.1 邮件列表管理软件存在命令注入漏洞，源于 %(listname) 宏扩展功能未对 shell 元字符进行有效过滤。拥有列表管理员权限的本地攻击者可通过构造包含 shell 元字符（如反引号、分号、管道符等）的列表名称，在宏扩展执行期间注入并执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制底层操作系统。该漏洞影响 Mailman 1.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），攻击向量为本地、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、完全影响机密性/完整性/可用性。攻击者需具备列表管理员权限方可利用，通过创建或修改包含恶意 shell 命令的列表名称实现任意代码执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0861"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37.287","remediation":"建议将 GNU Mailman 升级至 2.0b5 或更高版本（2.0 正式版）。该漏洞由 %(listname) 宏展开未过滤 shell 元字符导致，2.0b5 起已修复此问题并添加了适当的安全转义。可通过 ports 升级：在 /usr/ports/mail/mailman 目录执行 make reinstall，或从官网下载最新稳定版源码重新编译安装。如短期内无法升级且系统非必需，可暂时卸载 mailman 端口，或通过调整文件系统权限限制普通用户对 mailman 安装目录的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0040.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0112.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1667","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5493","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0861","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0861.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6w76-wp8w-rq73/GHSA-6w76-wp8w-rq73.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0861.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0979.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0978","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0978.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0860","title":"PHP PHP 3/4 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"PHP 3 和 4 版本的文件上传功能存在任意文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造隐藏表单字段，使其名称与 PHP 内部脚本变量名匹配，从而绕过访问控制读取服务器任意文件。该漏洞影响 PHP 3.x 和 4.x 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，仅影响机密性。攻击者可通过构造包含特定变量名的表单提交，利用 PHP 处理文件上传时对内部变量处理不当的缺陷，读取服务器上任意可读文件内容，导致敏感信息泄露。PHP 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0860"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37.143","remediation":"立即升级 PHP 至 8.3 或更高版本（PHP 3/4 已停止维护 20 余年），或至少升级至 PHP 4.0.3 及以上修复版本；若无法升级，在 php.ini 中设置 file_uploads = Off 禁用文件上传功能，并设置 register_globals = Off 关闭全局变量注册作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0455.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0477.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0150.html","http://cvsweb.php.net/viewcvs.cgi/php4/main/rfc1867.c.diff?r1=1.38%3Aphp_4_0_2&tr1=1.1&r2=text&tr2=1.45&diff_format=u","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1649","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5190","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0860","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0860.md","https://github.com/psecio/versionscan/blob/81cee8accd05924b8421db9ed2a867047819d15a/CONTRIBUTING.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2f2v-rgmc-w6fp/GHSA-2f2v-rgmc-w6fp.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0860.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/php_file_upload.nasl","https://github.com/fnmsd/awvs_script_decode/blob/ce24b3ea8777c948052eea831b614324fd4b638f/Scripts/XML/PHP_upload_arbitrary_file_disclosure_vulnerability.xml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0978.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0977","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0977.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0859","title":"Gordano NTMail Web配置服务器 HTTP请求处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gordano NTMail 5.0/6.0 Web 配置服务器的 HTTP 请求处理程序存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过发送一系列不完整的 HTTP 请求（部分 HTTP 请求），导致 Web 配置服务器资源耗尽或进程崩溃，从而拒绝合法用户的服务访问。该漏洞影响 Gordano NTMail 5.0 和 6.0 版本的 Web 配置管理接口，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于网络可利用、低攻击复杂度、无需认证、仅影响可用性的拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可远程发送构造的部分 HTTP 请求流触发漏洞，导致 Web 管理界面无响应或服务进程崩溃，需重启服务恢复。Gordano 官方已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级到修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0859"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37.020","remediation":"建议立即升级到Gordano NTMail 6.1或更高版本，并应用厂商发布的安全补丁。如无法立即升级，建议通过防火墙限制Web配置服务器管理端口（默认HTTP端口）仅允许受信任IP访问，或暂时禁用Web配置界面服务，改用命令行管理工具进行配置管理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0471.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1640","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0859","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0859.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-265j-44f5-74rh/GHSA-265j-44f5-74rh.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0859.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2f115c76-b238-4d99-aead-122aa77d05b0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0977.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0976","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0976.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0858","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 的 IIS 4.0 服务中 INETINFO.EXE 进程存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未经身份验证的攻击者可通过发送一系列畸形的 URL 请求，导致 INETINFO.EXE 进程崩溃或停止响应，从而造成 IIS 服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 IIS 4.0 的 Windows NT 4.0 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，仅影响可用性。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络发送畸形 URL 请求触发漏洞，导致 IIS 服务拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0858"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36.887","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Windows 2000 Server 及 IIS 5.0 以上版本，或安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-078 (KB273843) 修补补丁。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面拦截针对 IIS 的异常 URL 请求，或在 IIS 管理器中禁用不必要的 ISAPI 扩展映射作为临时缓解措施。如仍运行 Windows NT 4.0，强烈建议制定迁移计划尽快迁移至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vendor/2000-q3/0065.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/80413","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1642","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5202","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0858.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0858","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0858.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0858.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5jwv-6qp2-mgfr/GHSA-5jwv-6qp2-mgfr.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0858.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0858.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0858.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0976.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0975","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0975.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0857","title":"muh IRC 服务器日志功能格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"muh 2.05d IRC 服务器在处理用户昵称的日志记录功能时未对格式字符串进行有效过滤，存在格式字符串注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送包含格式化字符（如 %s、%n）的畸形昵称来触发该漏洞，成功利用后可导致服务器进程崩溃引发拒绝服务，或在部分平台下执行任意命令，进而完全控制运行 muh 服务器的宿主机。该漏洞影响所有使用 muh 2.05d 版本的 IRC 服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。由于利用仅需建立 IRC 连接并发送构造的昵称即可完成，攻击条件简单，无需身份验证或复杂交互，建议管理员尽快应用官方安全补丁进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0857"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36.770","remediation":"将 muh 2.05d IRC 服务器日志模块中所有直接使用用户输入（如 nickname）作为 format string 的 `sprintf`/`printf` 调用，改为使用 `snprintf` 或将用户输入作为参数传入（如 `log(\"user: %s\", nick)` 而非 `log(nick)`），确保格式字符串不被用户控制。若暂无法修改源码，可在服务器前端增加 nick 过滤规则，拒绝包含 \"%\" 字符的连接请求，或改用其他维护中的 IRC 服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0067.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0068.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1665","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5215","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4a89b44478cf1ae516da29bd6f16b00a8bec011/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0857","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0857.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d2521a6a6a6b95fdd6c2651e419302899bbee89/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/99cae226d61b8e74336dc0c5e362f6c067c34ab5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4fj3-9m57-2fx2/GHSA-4fj3-9m57-2fx2.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0857.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--de73e71b-684b-4dc2-8211-69186e3d4f73.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0975.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0974","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0974.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0856","title":"xs4all SunFTP 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SunFTP build 9(1) 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送超长的 GET 请求文件路径触发该漏洞。由于程序在处理请求时未对输入长度进行边界检查，导致缓冲区溢出，进而引发服务崩溃（拒绝服务），在某些条件下覆盖调用栈甚至可能执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 SunFTP 9(1) 版本，攻击者只需拥有目标主机的网络可达性即可发起攻击，无需凭据或交互，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高。xs4all Data 已在后续版本中修复了此缺陷，建议用户升级至最新版本并限制 FTP 服务的访问来源以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0856"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36.647","remediation":"SunFTP build 9(1) 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，厂商未发布补丁。建议立即升级 SunFTP 到最新可用版本，若无可升级版本，应在防火墙中限制 FTP 服务访问源 IP 并使用入侵检测系统过滤超长 GET 请求；同时禁用 SunFTP 的匿名登录功能，或替换为标准 FTP 服务器如 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0408.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1638","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0856","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0856.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4r2x-95jf-w8hr/GHSA-4r2x-95jf-w8hr.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/sunftpd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e2a2b761-e952-459d-a2a6-d662096582df.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0974.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0973","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0973.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0855","title":"Rasmus J.P. Allenheim SunFTP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SunFTP 1.0 Build 9 版本的 FTP 服务器在处理客户端 TCP 连接时存在拒绝服务漏洞。当远程攻击者向服务器发起连接后，在尚未发送任何包含换行符的数据之前即主动断开连接时，服务器会因此触发异常处理逻辑缺陷，进而导致服务无响应或崩溃退出。该漏洞影响运行 SunFTP 的所有操作系统平台，攻击者无需身份认证，只要目标服务器的 FTP 端口（21）网络可达即可实施攻击。利用方式极为简单，攻击者仅需建立连接后立即断开即可触发该漏洞，造成合法用户无法正常使用 FTP 文件传输服务，影响业务连续性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0855"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36.523","remediation":"SunFTP 1.0 build 9 存在连接关闭不当导致的拒绝服务漏洞，建议尽快升级至其他维护状态良好的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD 或 Pure-FTPd），或联系开发商获取修复版本。如无法立即更换，可在防火墙或 iptables 层面限制同一源 IP 短时间内向 FTP 服务发起大量新建连接，并使用 TCP Wrapper 限制可访问 FTP 端口的客户端地址范围，以降低被攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0408.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1637","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ca64b5ad6b84d3cd5741b023610b8494800f174/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0855","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0855.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/661818a489d196676957d469a0bf9cda171fbbe9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39d8887723797efc1804585dd06585c9fd751226/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-36cf-5wv3-q7jj/GHSA-36cf-5wv3-q7jj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1637/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--38836713-185b-4c01-ac8a-24e7cb5c607e.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/9b3499c7de21c9d65da447438f78347e1fbc9861/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0973.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0972","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0972.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0852","title":"FreeBSD eject 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 操作系统中 eject 命令存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞，eject 是用于弹出光盘、软盘等可移动介质的系统实用工具。由于程序在解析命令行参数及处理设备路径时未对缓冲区长度进行严格校验，本地已登录用户可通过传递超长或构造畸形的参数触发缓冲区溢出。成功利用该漏洞可导致在受影响系统上执行任意代码，由于 eject 通常以 root 权限运行，攻击者借此可直接获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 及存在相同代码的其他类 Unix 操作系统，需要攻击者拥有本地用户访问权限方可利用，成功利用后将完全危及系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0852"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36.143","remediation":"根据 FreeBSD 安全公告 FreeBSD-SA-00:49，建议升级 eject port/package 至修复后的 1.4 版本（2000-08-21 之后编译的包），或重新从 ports 构建该端口。具体操作：若已安装 eject port，可通过 ports 方式 cd /usr/ports/sysutils/eject 执行 make clean && make reinstall 重新编译安装；或直接从官方 FTP 下载修复后的安装包进行升级。如暂无法立即升级，可临时去除 /usr/local/sbin/eject 的 setuid 位权限（执行 chmod u-s /usr/local/sbin/eject）或将其限制为仅受信任的用户组可执行，以降低本地用户提权风险。同时建议检查系统是否有非预期的 eject 安装，如无需使用可直接卸载该端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0110.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1559","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1686","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5248","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9eab3e49abff7d8657a641d028b9281334f27eaa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0852","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0852.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ee8b01743dd7b9fb9124ebc430ff19a67c89c1a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/905c759ea25c11a59e5c85d4af57ced286cebb3a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mj35-xjx6-4738/GHSA-mj35-xjx6-4738.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--03ed5e03-52ee-4535-98e8-3e63d7d7afd7.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0972.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0971","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0971.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0850","title":"Netegrity SiteMinder 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Netegrity SiteMinder 是一款企业级 Web 访问管理与单点登录产品。在 4.11 及之前的版本中，该产品存在认证绕过漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者通过在请求 URL 末尾附加 \"$/FILENAME.ext\"（其中扩展名为 .ccc、.class 或 .jpg）的方式，可绕过 SiteMinder 的认证机制，直接访问受保护的 Web 资源。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 SiteMinder 的服务器，攻击者无需任何凭据，且攻击复杂度较低，只要能够网络访问目标服务器即可发起攻击。成功利用后，攻击者可在未授权的情况下访问受 SiteMinder 保护的应用程序和敏感数据，严重危害企业信息安全和访问控制体系的完整性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0850"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35.890","remediation":"将 Netegrity SiteMinder 升级至 4.11 或更高版本，以修复认证绕过漏洞。如暂无法升级，应在 Web 服务器或反向代理层添加 URL 过滤规则，拒绝包含 \"$/\" 路径以及 \".ccc\"、\".class\"、\".jpg\" 等扩展名的请求，防止攻击者通过拼接特殊后缀绕过认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a091100-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1681","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5230","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0850","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0850.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5vj6-cjv9-5x62/GHSA-5vj6-cjv9-5x62.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6101f955-02be-4223-8ec4-9cb5e88cf7e9.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0971.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0971.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0970","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0970.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0849","title":"微软 Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0849是Microsoft Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1中存在的一个竞态条件漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标系统的Windows Media Unicast Service发送特定格式的恶意请求触发 race 条件导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响Windows Media服务器的正常运行，使服务无法正常处理有效的媒体流请求，造成媒体服务拒绝服务。攻击者可以通过精心构造的畸形网络请求诱发系统在处理媒体服务过程中出现资源竞争或状态异常，最终导致服务不可用。尽管漏洞的CVSS评分较低（2.6）和攻击难度较高，但该漏洞仍可能被恶意攻击者利用，导致企业媒体服务中断，影响用户体验和业务 continuity。该漏洞已被Microsoft修复，补丁信息可在官方安全更新中获取。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0849"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35.773","remediation":"建议立即安装微软发布的安全补丁 MS00-086（针对 Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1），或升级至 Windows Media Services 9.0 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 1755 端口（Windows Media Unicast Service 默认端口），或禁用 Windows Media Unicast Service 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1655","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-064","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5193","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0849","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0849.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7v87-4jgh-cmq4/GHSA-7v87-4jgh-cmq4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cb8296e8-4bf4-43bd-aaa2-424ff5d37ae4.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8c4383d71e419cb5a91546cd7835b4f02c87cdaa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0970.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0969","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0969.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0847","title":"University of Washington pine IMAP 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"华盛顿大学 c-client 库（被 pine 等邮件客户端使用）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可发送超长的 X-Keywords 邮件头触发栈溢出，进而在受害者机器上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 c-client 库的邮件客户端（如 pine、alpine 等），CVSS 7.5 分（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击者只需发送一封包含超长 X-Keywords 头的恶意邮件即可触发，无需用户交互即可实现远程代码执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0847"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35.527","remediation":"建议升级 pine 和 alpine 邮件客户端至 2000 年 11 月后发布的版本（pine 4.44 及以上、alpine 0.999 及以上），或升级 UW c-client 库至 2000 年 11 月 14 日后发布的版本（c-client 2000c 及以上）。若无法立即升级，可在邮件服务器/防火墙层面配置规则拦截或截断超长 X-Keywords 头部（建议限制长度 ≤ 1024 字节）作为临时缓解措施，并建议迁移至维护中的现代邮件客户端（如 mutt、Thunderbird 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0425.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0437.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0108.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1646","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1687","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0847","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0847.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gr5x-qv58-9jgc/GHSA-gr5x-qv58-9jgc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9b9f071a-e82c-42cd-88f4-9984d0266feb.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8c4383d71e419cb5a91546cd7835b4f02c87cdaa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0969.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0968","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0968.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0845","title":"Digital Digital Unix 4.0F kdebugd 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"数字Unix 4.0F 系统中存在 kdebug 守护进程（kdebugd）漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标系统发送包含完整文件路径的初始化数据包，绕过路径限制访问系统中的任意文件。该漏洞可读取敏感配置文件、日志记录和认证凭据等关键文件，影响范围涵盖数字Unix 4.0F 所有版本。攻击条件为网络可达、低攻击复杂度、无需认证，利用方法为构造恶意初始化数据包并指定目标文件路径。 CVSS 评分 6.4，等级为中危威胁，目前仍无官方补丁修复。只需发送一个包含特定格式初始化包的网络数据包即可触发漏洞，对系统安全构成严重威胁。漏洞影响数字Unix 4.0F系统的整个文件系统中所有文件的可读性，攻击者可利用此漏洞获取系统关键配置、审计日志和用户认证信息等隐私数据，可能进一步伪造凭据或利用信息进行二次攻击。该漏洞存在于数字Unix系统的内核级调试进程中，其管理网络连接和初始化参数的功能被攻击者滥用，导致其文件访问控制逻辑被绕过，实现了对系统文件系统的横向遍历和敏感信息的非法获取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0845"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35.270","remediation":"在 Digital UNIX/Tru64 UNIX（受影响至 5.0）上编辑 /etc/inetd.conf，注释或删除 kdebugd 相关行以禁用该服务，保存后执行 kill -HUP $(cat /var/run/inetd.pid) 或重启 inetd 使配置生效；并升级至 Tru64 UNIX V5.1 及厂商初始补丁包以获得官方修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0204.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0845","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0845.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2pvg-4x8f-qx36/GHSA-2pvg-4x8f-qx36.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1693/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/713ffae93113b598a59dcb6e71997a603904c107/2000.tsv","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--813bb3d1-4fd1-43b0-a514-01fd092ab3d7.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0968.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0967","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0967.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0842","title":"SCO UnixWare 7 Web服务器任意文件读取漏洞","description":"UnixWare 7 scohelphttp webserver 的 search97cgi/vtopic 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过在参数中构造 ../ 目录遍历序列读取服务器任意文件。该漏洞源于输入验证缺失，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络发送恶意请求，利用 ../ 序列遍历目录结构读取敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd、配置文件等）。影响范围为运行 scohelphttp webserver 的 UnixWare 7 系统，CVSS 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响机密性。攻击者可通过构造包含 ../ 序列的 HTTP 请求实现任意文件读取，获取系统敏感信息。SCO 已发布补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0842"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.843","remediation":"建议升级 UnixWare 7 至最新补丁版本（安装 SCO 安全补丁 SCO-2000.09 或更高版本），或将 scohelphttp 服务禁用并禁用 search97cgi/vtopic CGI 程序。若无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器层配置路径遍历防护规则（如 Apache mod_rewrite 规则拦截包含 ../ 的请求），并在防火墙层面限制对 scohelphttp 端口（默认 457/tcp）的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0086.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1663","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0842","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0842.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9xqx-33g6-cjm5/GHSA-9xqx-33g6-cjm5.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1663/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/713ffae93113b598a59dcb6e71997a603904c107/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0967.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0966","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0966.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0839","title":"Ipswitch WinCOM LPD 1.00.90 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch WinCOM LPD 1.00.90 版本的 LPD 服务（端口 515）在处理大量 LPD 选项时存在缺陷，远程未认证攻击者可向 LPD 端口发送大量特制的 LPD 选项数据包，导致服务资源耗尽或进程崩溃，引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Ipswitch WinCOM LPD 1.00.90 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程发起攻击，利用方式为向目标主机 515 端口发送大量畸形或超量的 LPD 选项请求，导致 LPD 服务停止响应或崩溃，造成拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），影响可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0839"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.460","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Ipswitch WinCOM LPD 最新版本或迁移至现代打印解决方案（如 Progress WhatsUp Gold），若无法升级请在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 515 端口（LPD 端口）禁止外部访问，或在 Windows 服务中禁用 LPD Print Service 服务并重启服务生效。若必须保留打印服务，建议配置防火墙仅允许受信任 IP 访问 515 端口，并部署入侵检测规则监控异常 LPD 选项流量。建议尽快规划迁移至现代打印协议（IPP/IPPS）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0212.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1701","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5258","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0839.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0839.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0839","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0839.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0839.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jcv9-c2pf-8g3p/GHSA-jcv9-c2pf-8g3p.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0839.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0966.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0965","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0965.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0838","title":"Fastream FUR HTTP Server 1.0b GET请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Fastream FUR HTTP Server 1.0b 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，由于 Web 服务器对过长的 HTTP GET 请求缺乏长度校验，远程未认证攻击者可向目标服务器发送超长 GET 请求导致服务器进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Fastream FUR HTTP Server 1.0b 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需发送精心构造的超长 GET 请求即可触发漏洞，无需身份认证即可导致目标服务拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0838"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.343","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Fastream FUR HTTP Server 2.0 或更高版本（Fastream 已被 Peer Software 收购，建议迁移至 Peer Software 的现代文件同步解决方案）。如无法升级，请在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或反向代理层面配置规则限制 GET 请求 URL 长度不超过 2048 字符，并在防火墙层面限制单个 IP 的并发连接数，作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快迁移至现代维护中的 Web 服务器软件（如 Nginx、Apache、IIS 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q3/0111.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5237","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0838.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0838","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0838.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0838.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r6h8-3hr3-v266/GHSA-r6h8-3hr3-v266.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88316/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0838.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f074a35d-cca1-40eb-b858-13f9cb8ade0e.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f074a35d-cca1-40eb-b858-13f9cb8ade0e.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0965.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0965.toml"}]